    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "rebuilding sounds so exhausting though. like what's the point of rebuilding a house if the foundation is just gone? it feels like i'm just performing being a human. the athlete was the soul, and now there's just this broken machinery left behind. it feels so wrong to even be here.",
